WEBVTT

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:01.710
This place sure is packed!

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:04.070
Takagi-chan...

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:06.690
Um...

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:08.480
Do I...

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:13.320
Do I look weird in this swimsuit?

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:19.390
I think it looks cute!

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:21.710
Really? What a relief!

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:23.160
Let's get going!

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:25.340
They're probably waiting on us!

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:35.050
Ah, here they come!

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:37.010
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:40.640
It's a good thing it's sunny today.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:41.760
Yeah.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.760
<i>She's wearing that same swimsuit...</i>

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:58.420
Hey, what's so funny?

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:00.940
It's nothing.

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:02.200
Oh, okay.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.280
I'm sorry, Nakai-kun.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:06.870
We ended up taking too long.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:09.330
Eh, don't sweat it!

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.420
Okay...

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.550
So, what should we do?

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:14.970
Good question.

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:16.800
Hey Nishikata!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.760
Let's go on the water slide!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:19.810
Okay!

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:27.850
Don't you like my swimsuit!?

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.620
Wasn't he blushing?

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:37.990
No.

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:39.240
Oh...

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:44.530
Nakai-kun just prefers hanging with the guys instead.

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.910
Geez!

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.000
So let's hang out, Takagi-chan!

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:53.540
Come on, let's go!

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:56.500
We'll play pass with the beach ball!

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:04.550
That was fun!

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:12.980
Mano-chan!

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:17.230
Are you alright?

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.440
Sorry.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:20.650
I wasn't paying attention.

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:24.610
Let's take a break, okay?

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:33.750
Trying to find Nakai-kun?

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.210
Well, I...

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:40.850
Sorry, you guys don't go on dates that often.

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:42.420
I kinda ruined it, huh?

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:43.880
No way!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.470
I was the one who invited you!

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.850
I thought it'd be fun to hang out together!

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:57.770
Being alone with Nakai-kun makes me nervous.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:01.000
I'd rather hang out in a group.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:08.660
But, he did promise me we'd go on the water slide together.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.550
I'm worried that he forgot.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:16.460
What if you just asked him to go on it?

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.760
I could never do that!

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:22.340
He probably doesn't remember!

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.750
Why should I remind him?

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:26.010
Good point.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.770
I'll just wait until he remembers.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:30.940
You're gonna wait?

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.620
That's kinda risky.

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.480
I know that...

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.160
But...

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:40.780
I'm too embarrassed to ask him myself.

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:42.780
Oh, so that's why.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:49.310
Of course I want to go on it with him.

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:51.010
You're so romantic.

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:53.790
You mean you haven't heard?

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:55.630
About what?

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:59.010
Well, it's about the water slide here.

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:03.220
They say that if two people go on it together, they fall in love.

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:04.760
Really?

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.220
Now you guys <i>have </i>to ride it together!

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.100
Yeah!

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:12.890
On top of that, it works as an excuse to get closer to each other.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.150
Ah, so <i>that's</i> why!

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.920
Yeah...

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.760
But how am I gonna pull that off?

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:24.670
How would I get him to do it without outright asking?

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.240
Hmm...

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:28.200
I know!

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:30.910
How about I try to get Nishikata away from him?

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.180
Huh?

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:36.750
If Nakai-kun is by himself, then he'll definitely keep his promise with you!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:41.330
It's a lot more fun to be with someone than it is to be alone, especially at a pool.

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:47.200
But what if he forgot about his promise?

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:48.800
I'm sure he remembers!

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:52.930
But what if he doesn't?

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.010
Then go for it!

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:59.910
It'll be fine! I'm sure everything will work out in your favor.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:02.300
You... think so?

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:08.580
Takagi-chan!

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.700
Uh... thanks!

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:15.010
No prob! That's what friends are for!

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:17.160
You really didn't have to...

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:21.710
Besides, it gives <i>me</i> an excuse to be alone with Nishikata.

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:24.340
Ah, so <i>that's</i> why.

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:27.710
Ah, who knows?

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.950
What? They don't have any floaties!?

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:33.750
Even the beach had some to rent...

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:35.550
You didn't bring any with you?

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:36.560
Oh well!

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.640
Easy for you guys to say...

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:42.870
Whatever, I'll just sit and watch...

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.630
Just like in gym class?

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:47.550
There's no point in us being here if you don't swim!

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.360
Well, I can't!

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:52.350
I know, Yukari-chan!

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:54.850
What if you <i>could</i> swim?

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:56.850
That's easier said than done...

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:58.410
I'll teach you how!

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:03.040
<i>Alright, here we go!</i>

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:04.580
<i>You're doing great!</i>

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:06.590
<i>Look, mommy!</i>

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:11.320
From this day on, this place is gonna be your swim class!

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:13.660
Eh, I dunno about that...

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:15.730
What's with the attitude?

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:17.220
You gotta say "Yes, ma'am!"

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:18.220
Seriously?

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.650
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.970
Alrighty, let's start with some stretches!

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.770
Ah, we're starting with<i> that</i>.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.550
Say "Yes, ma'am!"

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:29.900
Nice to see <i>you're</i> into this...

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.740
Alright, let's begin!

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:40.080
One, two!

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:40.620
Huh?

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:41.750
I told you, say-

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:42.780
Wait a sec!

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:44.960
Did you guys just see Takagi-chan?

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.670
Huh?

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:54.150
Don't be a liar! As punishment, sing our school song!

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:56.620
None of this has to do with swimming...

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:04.090
How should I go about teasing him today?

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:09.170
Yeah!

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:12.510
Wooooo, oh yeah!

00:09:14.970 --> 00:09:17.310
That was a good run!

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.660
Let's do it again!

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:24.040
I think I've figured it out!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.150
What do you mean?

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:32.000
Cluttering my head with pointless thoughts, like if I'll catch the bus home in time, will make me slip up.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.730
Ah, I get it!

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:37.430
<i>Ah, it sure is nice to be away from the girls.</i>

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:41.890
<i>There's no way I could face Takagi-san when she's in a swimsuit.</i>

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:45.850
<i>If she knew how embarrassed I'd be, I'd never hear the end of it!</i>

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:50.480
<i>Nakai-kun seems to be handling things well though. I'm impressed...</i>

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.750
I'm glad you tagged along with us today.

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:53.750
Huh?

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:56.570
I think coming to the pool with a guy is a lot better.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:10:00.780
<i>Does that mean even Nakai-kun
is embarrassed like I am?</i>

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:06.710
If it was just Mano-chan and I, I wouldn't be able to go down the water slide a bunch.

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.810
<i>Ah, so he's not embarrassed about the girls at all!</i>

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:11.170
<i>Whoa!</i>

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:14.280
Hey Nishikata, have you ever went bungee jumping?

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:16.200
Huh? No...

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:19.780
Me neither, but I'd love to at least try it!

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:21.830
Uh, yeah...

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.670
Hey Nakai-kun, are you okay?

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:26.900
About what? Bungee jumping?

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:30.260
Uhh, not that...

00:10:30.260 --> 00:10:34.570
Aren't you supposed to be on a date with Mano-san?

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.030
Ah, don't worry about that.

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:40.480
I told her that we'd go down the water slide together later.

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:43.330
What? Don't worry? About <i>that</i>!?

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.950
Alright, let's do this.

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:48.500
I'm about to show you my best run ever!

00:10:56.280 --> 00:11:00.660
<i>Well, if Nakai-kun says it's fine, then it's gotta be...</i>

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:08.430
<i>This is anything BUT fine!</i>

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:11.070
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:17.030
<i>I need to get away from Nakai-kun!</i>

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.530
<i>I'll just go use the bathroom.</i>

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:21.100
<i>Wait, he'll just want to tag along!</i>

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:23.190
<i>I'll say I'm hungry and go get-</i>

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:26.190
<i>Can't do that either! He'll still want to come with!</i>

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:29.000
<i>He'll just make everything seem like no big deal!</i>

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:33.460
<i>Oh, so that's it? It's fine, don't worry!</i>

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:36.120
<i>But it really won't be fine!</i>

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.300
<i>I think I broke my leg? No, not that!</i>

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:39.880
<i>I think I left something behind? No!</i>

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:41.930
<i>My grandma said that she's... Ugh! Not that!</i>

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:53.420
Hey man, you good?

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:58.530
Sorry, I kinda spaced out...

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.490
Ack! I got water in my nose!

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:04.640
Oh? Thinkin' about Takagi-san, huh?

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:07.340
Uh, no way!

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:11.390
<i>That's it! If I told him that I needed to go see Takagi-san...</i>

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:15.200
<i>But wait, wouldn't that make it look like I actually want to go see her?</i>

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:24.130
Nishikata!

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.390
Hey!

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.000
What'cha doin'? Slide is this way!

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:30.890
What's up with you?

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:36.860
I just came up with a great plan to get revenge on Takagi-san.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:38.910
I wanna go try it out.

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:41.650
If you wanna go see Takagi-san, then just say so.

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:45.320
It's not like that...

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:02.080
Hey! What happened to class!?

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:05.530
Ah, just swim from that side to that side.

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:06.680
As if!

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:10.100
Why are you so scared of swimming anyway?

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:15.170
It's not that I'm scared of it...

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:19.180
It's just that I can't float...

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:21.960
Are you <i>that</i> heavy?

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.170
It's not my weight!

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:26.200
I know how much you weigh!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.410
How?

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:30.120
I peeked when we were doing our physicals!

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:31.330
How many kilos?

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:32.590
Fourty-

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:43.930
<i>Now that I think about it, I should probably pull Takagi-san away from Mano-san for this to work.</i>

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:46.830
<i>This plan is great, it's foolproof...</i>

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:48.360
<i>Wait, hold on...</i>

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:51.060
<i>Wouldn't that require me to talk to Takagi-san?</i>

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:53.520
<i>I'd be too embarrassed! What am I gonna do!?</i>

00:13:55.670 --> 00:13:56.650
Huh?

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:58.970
Nishikata!

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:04.990
Haven't seen you in forever.

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:09.450
Ah, yeah...

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:11.060
What are you doing all alone?

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:13.250
Wh-what about you?

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:15.620
I was looking for you.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.750
Huh!?

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:19.710
I felt like teasing you!

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:24.460
Were you by any chance looking for me too?

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:25.670
No.

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:30.000
I thought it'd be best to let Mano-san and Nakai-kun have some time alone.

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:36.400
But wouldn't that mean you <i>were</i> looking for me?

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:39.050
If that's what you want to believe...

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:40.510
So what are you doing now?

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:42.120
What do you mean?

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:44.640
I assume you weren't planning to space out, right?

00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:48.030
If someone saw us, it might raise a lot of questions.

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:55.620
Well, do you wanna go get a drink?

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:08.290
Ah, that hits the spot!

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:10.450
I wonder how Mano-chan and Nakai-kun are doing?

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:13.280
I think they're gonna go on the water slide together.

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:16.420
Ah, so Nakai-kun remembered after all!

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.420
Did Mano-san bring it up?

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:20.730
Yeah, a whole bunch!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:24.840
So he <i>did</i> remember! What a relief!

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:34.870
Hey, Nishikata.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.720
What?

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.730
Let's go spy on them!

00:15:39.440 --> 00:15:41.290
<i>Yep, that's it!</i>

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.130
<i>I see!</i>

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:52.300
They're heading for the water slide!

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:54.160
Let's follow them!

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:57.880
Haven't we done enough? They're fine...

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:00.050
Just to make sure, 'kay?

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:03.350
Oh, fine...

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.740
It's a lot more fun when you go fast.

00:16:06.740 --> 00:16:09.850
Yeah, but I'm a little scared...

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:14.430
<i>Don't worry! This is nothing like a roller coaster or anything!</i>

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:18.190
Hey, why are you staring off over there?

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.300
Just 'cause...

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:23.270
I like the view from over here.

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:24.740
Is that so?

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:26.220
<i>Alright!</i>

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.980
Hey, wait! Who's gonna go in front?

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:32.740
Doesn't matter to me!

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.410
If you're too scared, I could go in front.

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:39.620
No, I want you in the back! If we did it that way, then maybe...

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:41.710
Alright!

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:44.190
<i>Alright, on three! One, two...</i>

00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:48.840
Ah, there they go! Nice!

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:55.790
Hey, since we came all the way up here, why don't we go down the slide too!

00:16:58.150 --> 00:16:59.750
Seperately.

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:04.320
If you wanna go down together, then that's fine too.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:06.500
Nah, you can go first...

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:11.460
<i>There's no way I can fight back, her swimsuit is too much...</i>

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:20.170
If you can't catch up with me, then you lose!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:23.000
Go!

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:25.810
<i>Damn you, Takagi-san!</i>

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:28.770
<i>You think I'm so embarrassed that I won't catch up?</i>

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.090
<i>I'll show you!</i>

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:37.110
Ah, you guys came too?

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:38.350
Uh, yeah!

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:41.410
Oh, what's this? You two at the pool together?

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.080
What lovebirds!

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.990
Sure, I guess. What about you guys?

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:47.530
Ah, we're here for <i>that!</i>

00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:50.570
Hey, why don't we all hit the water slide then?

00:17:56.630 --> 00:18:00.820
Uh, nah nevermind. I uh, wanted to go get some food!

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:02.560
Huh? You want food?

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.910
You want some too, right Takao?

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:07.020
Come on, let's go!

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:08.210
No? I'd rather be-

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:09.690
Yeah, that's the spirit!

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:12.410
See you later, guys!

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:20.690
<i>I am calm, free from any intruding thoughts...</i>

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:24.370
<i>Become one with the water, just focus on your speed...</i>

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:29.780
Ah, you sure are fast, Nishikata!

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:31.880
<i>You messed up big time, Takagi-san!</i>

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:35.580
<i>You think your swimsuit is your saving grace? Think again!</i>

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.830
Oh yeah, Mano-chan mentioned to me,

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:41.970
that if two people went down this slide together, they'd fall in love!

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:52.020
<i>Damn you, Takagi-san!</i>

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:07.650
Looks like I won!

00:19:08.510 --> 00:19:10.750
<i>Even when I had the upper hand...</i>

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:14.820
<i>I lost... just like that...</i>

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:20.680
Ah, so you guys went down together too!

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:22.140
What's wrong?

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.030
I got water in my nose.

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:26.670
Too much on your mind, huh?

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:32.630
You guys should have went down in each other's arms!

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:35.380
Didn't I tell you what would happen?

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:36.920
Ah, force of habit...

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:38.780
Huh, habit?

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:41.730
Anyway, the water slide was a lot of fun!

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:42.860
Yeah.

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:45.030
Alright, Nishikata!

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:47.030
Let's hit the slide again!

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:48.380
Okay...

00:19:57.670 --> 00:20:00.290
Wanna hit the lazy river, Takagi-chan?

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:01.660
Sure!

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:10.060
That was fun!

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:11.060
Yeah.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.550
We should do this again!

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:17.430
Wait, is that...?

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:25.270
They came too, huh?

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:33.600
I swear I saw Takagi-chan here today...

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:37.110
You're <i>that</i> sure she was here?

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:40.450
I guess I'm just losing faith in myself...

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:46.390
It's okay, Yukari-chan!

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:49.060
Even if you wear glasses and you can't swim,

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:51.890
you'll always be our friend!

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:54.230
Even if you're heavy, too.

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:55.650
Lay off!

00:20:57.680 --> 00:20:59.520
Today was a blast!

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:01.280
Let's hang out again!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.810
Well, see you guys later!

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:15.110
Let's head to the bus stop.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:16.820
Okay.

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:26.330
Your face was red all day, Nishikata!

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:28.540
I wouldn't say that...

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.230
<i>Only because you were teasing me...</i>

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:39.190
<i>But now she's not in her swimsuit anymore, so now I can return the favor!</i>

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:42.480
Hey, Nishikata.

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:47.950
Next time, let's go down the water slide again.

00:21:49.230 --> 00:21:52.980
<i>...if two people went down this slide together, they'd fall in love!</i>

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:57.440
Seperately, that is.

00:21:58.090 --> 00:22:00.360
Only if I get to go first!

00:22:00.360 --> 00:22:03.260
Fine by me, I'll do my best to catch up!

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:06.540
Hey... Takagi-sa...
